---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Blog
heading: From the field — daily work & videos
crumb: Blog
lede: Real installations, real numbers, real Melbourne roofs. We post what we did, what we learned, and the video to go with it.
metaTitle: Solar & Battery Installation Blog — Daily Work from Melbourne
metaDescription: "Daily installation notes and videos from Gigawatt Energy — solar, battery backup, EV charger and switchboard jobs across Melbourne's north and west."
permalink: /blog/
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
      <div class="card post-card">
        <span class="post-tag">{{ post.data.tags[0] if post.data.tags else "Field notes" }}</span>
        <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ post.data.metaDescription }}</p>
        <p class="post-meta" style="margin:.8rem 0 0">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
